      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know what the doctors say but it dont feel like a \"response\" to stress. it just feels like the truth. like being a human is just this heavy, exhausting performance i have to keep up. if i'm just a ghost in a machine or whatever, wouldn't it be easier to just... stop trying to exist in that loud, fake world? it feels like such a waste of energy to keep pretending i'm even part of it.",
